'''Konahrik'''
[[File:SR-npc-Spectral_Dragon_Priest.jpg|thumb|left|Spectral Dragon Priest summoned by Konahrik]]
The mask [[Skyrim:Konahrik|Konahrik]], which can only be acquired after recovering the other 9 Dragon Priest masks (8 named masks plus the [[Skyrim:Wooden Mask|Wooden Mask]]) from the base game, has the ability to summon a spectral Dragon Priest that will fight for you for 60 seconds.
